From adf74ec339f6c11ded7fe65234e9eb6a8ff76183 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gatien Chevallier <gatien.chevallier@st.com>
Date: Thu, 31 Mar 2022 14:23:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 0473/1695] clk: stm32mp25: add RIF support for RCC

This driver implements RIF configuration for RCC, which is a RIF
aware IP. It means that the RCC driver is in charge of configuring its
own RIF restrictions and that the RCC has dedicated RIF configuration
registers.

RIF configuration is part of stm32_clk_platdata.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git c2cb10fcb71ef7626164ec5fd82d51b3b468567a clk: stm32mp25: add RIF support for RCC]
Signed-off-by: Gatien Chevallier <gatien.chevallier@st.com>
